.TH GEMTEXT2MD 1 "2026-11-09"
.SH NAME
gemtext2md \- convert Gemtext to Markdown
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gemtext2md
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B gemtext2md
reads Gemtext on standard input and writes Markdown, intended to be
CommonMark, to standard output.
It takes no options.
.SH INPUT
The input format is described in
.BR gemtext (7).
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
gemtext2md < page.gmi > page.md
.fi
.SH EXIT STATUS
.B 0
on success, and non-zero if the input is malformed, or if a write or other
error occurs.
A diagnostic is printed to standard error.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gemtext (7),
.BR gemtext2mom (1),
.BR gemtext2pdf (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Martin Keegan
